<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Tobacco H1 net falls 37.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Tobacco H1 net falls 37.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		    (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 11.94     vs	  19.08</p>
<p>    Shr	   (cents)     5.9	vs	   9.4</p>
<p>    Dividend    (cents)    10.0	vs	  10.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		  262.04     vs	 269.22</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   17.27     vs	  27.26</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of company is Malaysian Tobacco Company Bhd.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
